  "text": "The tale of Nera sends a warrior through the cave of Cruachan into the Otherworld. That cave is the doorway he uses. Related accounts follow Connla, whom a fairy woman lures to the Otherworld. Another follows Cormac, whom fairy music draws to seek an Otherworld lover. A further tale follows Laoghaire, son of Crimthann, who aids an Otherworld peer in freeing that peer's wife, whom the surface world had taken prisoner.",
